{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_03",
  "title": "黃金蘿蔔",
  "storyCode": "DT-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "08f2ee9b3354e6f97b7ac875725331e9224fd3cae8f8a005acc30012e9b4c48d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……小心！我們好像是掉進礦洞裡了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照剛才那個工人的說法，源石蟲已經在這個礦洞裡築起自己的巢穴了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為工廠快要倒閉了，所以這裡就被源石蟲佔領了嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡有赤金源石蟲嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊的那群看起來只是普通的源石蟲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁牠們還沒發現我們，快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡也沒有赤金源石蟲，老夫看了，都是普通的品種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "《鮑勃的美食指南》上寫赤金源石蟲是荒野上的常見品種，“生活在岩石縫或者是洞穴中”“與其他品種的源石蟲生活習性相同”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡應該就能找到的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你沒有感覺到自己的頭上有東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這隻是源石蟲的幼蟲，牠的甲殼部分剛剛長成，現在還是比較柔軟的狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上牠正在努力分泌黏液固化甲殼，所以體溫上升了不少，讓牠趴在頭上還蠻舒服的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾要不要試一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再往裡面走感覺就有點不妙了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了源石蟲，好像還有別的生物在那裡活動的聲音……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們就在這裡返回吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是還沒找到赤金源石蟲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡真的有這個品種嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許赤金源石蟲的分泌物用金色的粉就能代替呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再深入一點點吧，老夫不想讓那些真心期盼黃金蘿蔔的年輕人失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，找到了赤金源石蟲，說不定就能買那輛車了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓，你們腳步聲小一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後面還有一群，也不像是赤金源石蟲啊……都不是金色的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——是酸液源石蟲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大鮑勃說過，這東西的黏液腐蝕性很強！小心不要被黏液濺到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要使用太大的魔法把牠們一下子全都殺死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管、管不了了啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咒語）——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "召喚術？不行，完全來不及！防禦魔法？魔力好像不太夠……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡，在這裡用法杖的話我的魔法還是無法順暢地施展……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，閃光魔法……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再試一下用手電筒吧——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然之前老闆能用它放出閃光，那拿它來增強閃光魔法應該沒什麼問題吧……？不過閃光魔法對這群魔物有沒有用……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾！快！源石蟲越來越多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒時間再想了，就是現在……閃光——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克&萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇！！居然一下子全都解決了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！成功了！我好像有點懂這裡的魔法是怎麼回事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了手電筒！你是我在這裡第一個成功使用的魔法器具！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在可不是想這些的時候！牠們的黏液被弄得到處都是啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！別讓它接觸到皮膚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，手電筒它……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "D32鋼手電筒頂端凝聚著的光芒暗淡了下來，原本正常運行著的零件冒出不妙的火花，嗞嗞作響。\n還沒等瑪露希爾反應過來，手電筒冒出滾滾濃煙，掉在了地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手電筒……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾！別愣著了！你身上也濺到黏液了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚……我的手電筒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像壞了啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然我們等一下回去讓那個老闆幫你看看怎麼修一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這個黏液的這種氣味……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好聞的味道，和之前的黏液聞起來很不一樣，更像是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個……酸酸甜甜的味道！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……你們別隨便亂吃蟲子的黏液啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……是酸甜的，味道的確很不錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顏色也很好看，金燦燦的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金色……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被用D32鋼手電筒釋放的魔法影響，黏液的顏色變成了金色，味道也很不錯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫覺得牠們或許可以當成赤金源石蟲的代替品！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……原本有腐蝕性的黏液在魔法的影響下變得可以食用了，好神奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但原本這種黏液是儲存在源石蟲體內的，我們得先把它們收集起來，再把它們做成這種可以食用的液體才行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別告訴我你們要收集已經掉在地上的這些……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，做料理的食材一定要保證是健康乾淨的。地上的老夫只是嚐一下，並不會用它做料理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，量也不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是想確保能做出黃金蘿蔔，還是要收集還在源石蟲體內的黏液才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
